  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the lamb shoulder and cook until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the sliced onions and bell peppers and cook until the vegetables are tender, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic, thyme, and red pepper flakes and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Assemble the wraps by placing a portion of the lamb and vegetable mixture onto each tortilla.",
    "Top with arugula, feta cheese (if using), and a drizzle of lemon juice.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!",
    "Reheat any leftover wraps in the skillet or oven until crispy and hot.",
    "Note: You can also grill the lamb and vegetables for a smoky flavor."
